n\r\nBut on `Android 8.1`, the navigation bar becomes bright in `Edge to Edge` mode. _(I found a solution.)_\r\nI'm not entirely sure about `Edge to Edge`. Shouldn't the system bars remain transparent there?\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Tests / Screenshots on LG Nexus 5X, Android 8.1</summary>\r\n\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n`Beta 3` with `Edge to Edge`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"659\" height=\"374\" alt=\"Bildschirmfoto 2025-07-13 um 02 09 40\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da3eb425-8309-4e29-b24c-63a07a848db9\" />\r\n\r\n-------------\r\n\r\nthis PR + `window.navigationBarColor = Color.BLACK`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"659\" height=\"374\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73f1f8e6-32bd-471e-874b-4bc7ebeb89ee\" />\r\n\r\n--------------\r\n\r\nthis PR without `window.navigationBarColor = Color.BLACK` _(the buttons / symbols are difficult to recognize)_\r\n\r\n<img width=\"657\" height=\"373\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/810d9192-9e58-4997-8cae-8ef433e6d01d\" />\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n--------\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\twindow.decorView.systemUiVisibility = 0\r\n\t\t\twindow.navigationBarColor = Color.BLACK\r\n\t\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2025-07-13T00:34:17Z","updated_at":"2025-07-13T00:34:28Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108557#discussion_r2203035416","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108557","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2203035416"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108557#discussion_r2203035416"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108557"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2203035416/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":nul